Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 04:17:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] tonight: P1 route tooling (launcher overrides, path gate,
 bench/logging tools, console re-arm fix)

P1.1  setup/dryrun_bringup.sh: LAKSA_NAV_ERPM, LAKSA_CRUISE_ERPM,
      LAKSA_DRIVER_CAP, LAKSA_BT_XML, LAKSA_NAV_EXTRA, LAKSA_NAV_CMD_TOPIC
      overrides. Unset, the generated commands are identical to before
      (checked for start and trial). Set values are validated before
      anything starts; effective values and the supervisor's arguments go
      to session.txt.
P1.2  laksa_learned_driver/config/nav2_tonight_overrides.yaml (FollowPath
      speeds 0.22/0.21/0.21, collision detection, reversing allowed).
P1.3  laksa_bringup/config/navigate_plan_once.xml: ComputePathToPose then
      FollowPath, no replanning or recoveries.
P1.4  setup/tonight/path_gate.py: fail-closed relay /laksa/nav_cmd_vel_raw ->
      /laksa/nav_cmd_vel, only while the active goal's own plan passed the
      footprint/unknown/grid/forward-only/curvature checks; FAIL latches,
      cancels navigation. test_path_gate.py: 11 required cases + 6 more.
P1.5  setup/tonight/restart_supervisor.sh (+ --dry-run).
P1.6  setup/tonight/vesc_logger.py (record, --mark, analyze).
P1.7  setup/tonight/start_reliability.sh (loops traction_bench.py).
P1.10 console: after a heartbeat loss mid-hold, HOLD/GO are ignored until
      released (hold_latch.py + test); the page says "release and press again".
P1.11 setup/tonight/wait_spin.py.
      setup/tonight/topic_publishers.py: publisher counts without the ros2 daemon cache.

